    <title>
        Rebuild unlocks from the Discord posts; exams unchanged
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-06T23:19:12Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240247449?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>nicholasbeskow</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/nicholasbeskow</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Rebuild unlocks from the Discord posts; exams unchanged

Carries a shared tag forward onto repeated lectures. build_week.py omits the
tag block when a lecture&amp;#39;s cards were unlocked earlier in the week, which the
addon rendered as &amp;quot;Tag missing&amp;quot; -- indistinguishable from a lecture that has
no tag at all. The tag comes from tag_map.xlsx and is verified to appear
verbatim in that week&amp;#39;s posts before being carried.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PViiq1eH5i73ZK6r8bLmcR&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
